{%- set tokens = schemas.v04Tokens -%}
<section>
  <p class="eyebrow">Docs</p>
  <h1>Schemas</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    JSON Schemas for validating Design Lasagna tokens, utilities, icons, and
    component lifecycle metadata. For how extensions and manifests fit
    together, read <a href="/tools/schemas/">schema concepts</a>.
  </p>

  <section id="use">
    <h2>Use a schema</h2>
    <dl class="schema-install__sources">
      <div><dt><code>$schema</code></dt><dd><code>https://designlasagna.recipes/schemas/&lt;format&gt;/&lt;contract&gt;.json</code>, for example <code>{{ tokens.canonicalUrl }}</code></dd></div>
      <div><dt>Install</dt><dd><code>npm install {{ schemaPackage.name }}@{{ schemaPackage.version }}</code></dd></div>
      <div><dt>Import</dt><dd><code>import schema from '{{ tokens.npmImportPath }}' with { type: 'json' };</code></dd></div>
    </dl>
    <p>
      <strong>Format version ≠ package version:</strong> format
      <code>v0.4</code> is what goes in <code>$schema</code>; package
      <code>{{ schemaPackage.version }}</code> is what you install
      (<a href="/docs/schemas/migrate-v0.3-to-v0.4/#format-vs-package">details</a>).
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="v0-4">
    <h2>v0.4 <span class="version-status">Current · default</span></h2>
    <div class="tool-cards schemas-tool-cards" aria-label="v0.4 contracts">
      <article class="tool-card">
        <h3><a href="/docs/schemas/v0.4/dtcg-extensions/">DTCG token extensions</a></h3>
        <p>Optional governance metadata in DTCG <code>$extensions</code>.</p>
        <p><span class="schema-list__label">Raw JSON</span><a href="/schemas/v0.4/dtcg-extensions.json">dtcg-extensions.json</a></p>
      </article>
      <article class="tool-card">
        <h3><a href="/docs/schemas/v0.4/tokens/">Tokens</a></h3>
        <p>Resolved token manifest.</p>
        <p><span class="schema-list__label">Raw JSON</span><a href="/schemas/v0.4/tokens.json">tokens.json</a></p>
      </article>
      <article class="tool-card">
        <h3><a href="/docs/schemas/v0.4/utilities/">Utilities</a></h3>
        <p>Utilities manifest.</p>
        <p><span class="schema-list__label">Raw JSON</span><a href="/schemas/v0.4/utilities.json">utilities.json</a></p>
      </article>
      <article class="tool-card">
        <h3><a href="/docs/schemas/v0.4/icons/">Icons</a></h3>
        <p>Icons manifest.</p>
        <p><span class="schema-list__label">Raw JSON</span><a href="/schemas/v0.4/icons.json">icons.json</a></p>
      </article>
      <article class="tool-card">
        <h3><a href="/docs/schemas/v0.4/components/">Components</a></h3>
        <p>Lifecycle extensions for Custom Elements Manifest entries.</p>
        <p><span class="schema-list__label">Raw JSON</span><a href="/schemas/v0.4/cem-extensions.json">cem-extensions.json</a></p>
      </article>
      <article class="tool-card">
        <h3><a href="/docs/schemas/v0.4/lifecycle/">Lifecycle</a></h3>
        <p>Composable lifecycle fragments the other contracts reference.</p>
        <p><span class="schema-list__label">Raw JSON</span><a href="/schemas/v0.4/lifecycle.json">lifecycle.json</a></p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="v0-3">
    <h2>v0.3 <span class="version-status">Previous · compatibility</span></h2>
    <p>
      Still on v0.3? Read the reference for
      <a href="/docs/schemas/v0.3/dtcg-extensions/">DTCG token extensions</a>,
      <a href="/docs/schemas/v0.3/tokens/">tokens</a>,
      <a href="/docs/schemas/v0.3/utilities/">utilities</a>, or
      <a href="/docs/schemas/v0.3/components/">components</a>, then follow the
      <a href="/docs/schemas/migrate-v0.3-to-v0.4/">migration guide</a>
      (<a href="/tools/schemas/changelog/">changelog</a>).
    </p>
  </section>
</section>
